---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
const APP = 'https://app.mtf.exchange';
---
<Base
  title="MetaFlux — Derivatives, on first principles."
  description="Perpetuals on crypto, US stocks, A-shares, commodities and FX, matched and settled on MetaFlux's own L1. The testnet is open."
  canonical="https://mtf.exchange/"
  script={false}
>
<Fragment slot="head"><script src="/home.js" is:inline defer></script></Fragment>
<Nav current="home" overlay />

<section class="hero dark" aria-labelledby="h1">
  <canvas id="stage" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <div id="stage-fallback" aria-hidden="true" hidden><i class="mark"></i></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <a class="announce" href="#updates"><span class="tag">New</span><span>ipo, a MIP-3 market: 21 stock, commodity and FX perpetuals</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <h1 id="h1">Derivatives,<br>on first principles.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Perpetuals on crypto, US stocks, A‑shares, commodities and FX, matched and settled on MetaFlux's own L1. The testnet is open.</p>
      <div class="ctas">
        <a class="pill solid" href={`${APP}/`}>Start trading</a>
        <a class="pill line" href="/whitepaper.html">Read the whitepaper</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-tape" aria-label="Market prices from the testnet"><div class="track" id="tape"><div></div><div aria-hidden="true"></div></div></div>
</section>

<section class="light sec" id="trade" aria-labelledby="th">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="label">Trade everything in one place</div>
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2 id="th">BTC, Apple, Moutai, gold and the euro, from one account.</h2>
      <a class="pill solid" href={`${APP}/`}>Trade</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="frame"><img class="shot" src="/shots/app.webp" width="3200" height="1760" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="The MetaFlux trading app on testnet: the BTC-USDC perpetual with its chart, order book, order ticket and an account with open positions."></div>
    <p class="cap">The trading app on testnet. Sample account and market figures, for illustration.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="light sec tight" id="markets" aria-labelledby="mh">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="label">Markets</div>
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2 id="mh">28 perpetual markets</h2>
      <p class="mute">Seven native crypto markets, and 21 US stock, A-share, commodity and FX markets on ipo, a MIP-3 market deployed on MetaFlux. A-shares follow the Shanghai and Shenzhen calendar. Prices come from the testnet as they change.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter markets">
      <button type="button" data-f="Crypto" aria-pressed="true">Crypto</button>
      <button type="button" data-f="Stock" aria-pressed="false">US stocks</button>
      <button type="button" data-f="AShare" aria-pressed="false">A-shares</button>
      <button type="button" data-f="Commodity" aria-pressed="false">Commodities</button>
      <button type="button" data-f="FX" aria-pressed="false">FX</button>
    </div>
    <div class="tbl">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Market</th><th class="r">Price</th><th class="r">24h</th><th class="r">Max leverage</th><th>Class</th><th></th></tr></thead>
        <tbody id="rows"><tr class="wait"><td colspan="6" class="mute">Prices load from the testnet.</td></tr></tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="light sec tight" id="apps" aria-labelledby="ah">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="label" id="ah">Apps</div>
    <div class="list">
      <a href={`${APP}/trade/perp/ipo:AAPL-USDC`}><b>ipo</b><span>A MIP-3 market: US stocks, A-shares, commodities and FX as perpetuals</span><em>APP.MTF.EXCHANGE</em><i>↗</i></a>
      <a href="https://grad2.xyz/"><b>Grad2</b><span>Deposit native ETH to MetaFlux. BTC and SOL are next.</span><em>GRAD2.XYZ</em><i>↗</i></a>
      <a href={`${APP}/vaults`}><b>Vaults</b><span>Deposit USDC into a strategy run by a vault leader</span><em>APP.MTF.EXCHANGE/VAULTS</em><i>↗</i></a>
      <a href={`${APP}/referrals`}><b>Referrals</b><span>Share a code; traders who use it get 5% off fees</span><em>APP.MTF.EXCHANGE/REFERRALS</em><i>↗</i></a>
      <a href={`${APP}/faucet`}><b>Faucet</b><span>Testnet USDC to start trading</span><em>APP.MTF.EXCHANGE/FAUCET</em><i>↗</i></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="light sec tight" id="build" aria-labelledby="bh">
  <div class="wrap two">
    <div>
      <div class="label">Deploy a market · MIP-3</div>
      <h2 id="bh">List your own markets on MetaFlux.</h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="body">Under MIP-3, any team can deploy perpetual markets with its own oracle and leverage caps. The deployer posts a bond in MTF and runs the price feed. MetaFlux runs matching, margin and settlement, and the markets trade from the same accounts as every other market.</p>
      <p class="body">ipo is a MIP-3 market deployed this way. It lists US stocks, A-shares, gold, oil, the euro and the pound.</p>
      <div class="ctas"><a class="pill solid" href="https://docs.mtf.exchange/mip/mip-3">Start building</a><a class="pill ghost" href="https://docs.mtf.exchange/api">API reference</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="vision dark sec" aria-label="Principles">
  <div class="wrap">
    <ol>
      <li><span class="n">01</span><p>MetaFlux is a derivatives exchange built as its own blockchain. The order book, the margin engine and settlement are one system.</p></li>
      <li><span class="n">02</span><p>Every order, cancel, fill and liquidation is a transaction that the validators agree on. Anyone can check it.</p></li>
      <li><span class="n">03</span><p>A trade is final in the block that prints it. There is no settlement queue behind the exchange.</p></li>
      <li><span class="n">04</span><p>One account trades every market, and cross positions share one balance.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="light sec" id="security" aria-labelledby="sh">
  <div class="wrap two">
    <div>
      <div class="label">Security</div>
      <h2 id="sh">MetaFlux is secured by MetaFluxBFT, a proof-of-stake consensus built for low latency.</h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="body">A block commits when validators holding more than two thirds of the stake sign it. The testnet runs five validators.</p>
      <p class="body">Matching, clearing and the EVM run inside the same consensus rounds. Every order, cancel, trade and liquidation happens on chain, with one-block finality.</p>
      <p class="body">MetaFlux is non-custodial. Orders are signed with EIP-712 by the account or by an agent wallet the account approves, and an agent wallet can never withdraw.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="points dark sec" id="points" aria-labelledby="pth">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <div class="label">MTF Points</div>
      <h2 id="pth">Trade the testnet. Earn points every week.</h2>
      <p>Each week shares 1,000,000 points by qualifying volume, counted from genesis. Up to 100,000,000 MTF across four seasons, claimable at the TGE.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="clock" aria-live="off">
      <div class="lab" id="clock-lab">This week closes in</div>
      <div class="t num"><div><b id="cd-d">0</b><span>days</span></div><div><b id="cd-h">00</b><span>hours</span></div><div><b id="cd-m">00</b><span>minutes</span></div><div><b id="cd-s">00</b><span>seconds</span></div></div>
      <a class="pill solid" href={`${APP}/points`}>Check your points</a>
      <div class="foot">Weeks close Wednesday 00:00 UTC. TGE target 1 March 2027.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="light sec tight" id="updates" aria-labelledby="uh">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="label" id="uh">Updates</div>
    <div class="list news">
      <a href={`${APP}/announcements`}><span class="src">METAFLUX<br><time datetime="2026-10-05">OCT 5, 2026</time></span><b>ipo, a MIP-3 market, opens with 21 stock, commodity and FX perpetuals</b><i>↗</i></a>
      <a href={`${APP}/announcements`}><span class="src">METAFLUX<br><time datetime="2026-10-05">OCT 5, 2026</time></span><b>MTF Points: Season 1, Ginnungagap, counts every trade since genesis</b><i>↗</i></a>
      <a href={`${APP}/announcements`}><span class="src">METAFLUX<br><time datetime="2026-10-05">OCT 5, 2026</time></span><b>Referral codes: 5% off trading fees for referred traders</b><i>↗</i></a>
      <a href={`${APP}/announcements`}><span class="src">GRAD2<br><time datetime="2026-10-05">OCT 5, 2026</time></span><b>Grad2 opens on testnet with native ETH deposits</b><i>↗</i></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="light sec tight" id="faq" aria-labelledby="fh">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="label" id="fh">FAQ</div>
    <div class="faq">
      <details><summary>What is MetaFlux?</summary><p>MetaFlux is a layer-1 blockchain built for derivatives. It runs perpetual futures and spot markets on order books that the validators match inside consensus, and it has its own EVM.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What can I trade?</summary><p>Perpetuals on BTC, ETH, SOL and other crypto, and on ipo, a MIP-3 market, US stocks, A-shares, gold, oil and FX. A-shares follow the Shanghai and Shenzhen trading calendar.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Is MetaFlux live?</summary><p>The testnet is live and open to everyone. Get testnet USDC from the <a href={`${APP}/faucet`}>faucet</a> and trade. Mainnet follows the audits.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What are MTF Points?</summary><p>Points for testnet trading volume, counted each week from genesis. They convert to MTF at the TGE, targeted for 1 March 2027. The formula is public on the <a href="/tge.html">points page</a>.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What is MTF?</summary><p>MTF is the native token of MetaFlux, with a fixed supply of 1,000,000,000.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<Footer />
</Base>

<script>
  const canvas = document.getElementById('stage') as HTMLCanvasElement;
  const fallback = () => {
    canvas.hidden = true;
    document.getElementById('stage-fallback')!.hidden = false;
  };
  import('three').then(({ WebGLRenderer, Scene, PerspectiveCamera, Group, BufferGeometry, BufferAttribute, ShaderMaterial, AdditiveBlending, Points }) => {
    const renderer = new WebGLRenderer({ canvas, antialias: true, alpha: true });
    renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio, 2));
    const scene = new Scene();
    const camera = new PerspectiveCamera(32, 1, 0.1, 100);
    const group = new Group();
    scene.add(group);

    // Each row is the price distribution at one horizon: narrow at the front, wider and flatter as it recedes.
    const NX = 320, NZ = 170;
    const pos = new Float32Array(NX * NZ * 3), row = new Float32Array(NX * NZ);
    let k = 0;
    for (let j = 0; j < NZ; j++) for (let i = 0; i < NX; i++, k++) {
      pos[k * 3] = -3.4 + (6.8 * i) / (NX - 1);
      row[k] = j / NZ;
    }
    const geo = new BufferGeometry();
    geo.setAttribute('position', new BufferAttribute(pos, 3));
    geo.setAttribute('aRow', new BufferAttribute(row, 1));
    const mat = new ShaderMaterial({
      transparent: true, depthWrite: false, blending: AdditiveBlending,
      uniforms: { uTime: { value: 0 }, uPx: { value: renderer.getPixelRatio() } },
      vertexShader: `
        attribute float aRow; uniform float uTime; uniform float uPx; varying float vA;
        void main() {
          float r = fract(aRow + uTime * 0.018);
          float t = mix(1.0, 9.0, r);
          float s0 = 0.36, s = s0 * sqrt(t);
          float x = position.x;
          float h = 2.3 * exp(-x * x / (2.0 * s * s)) * (s0 / s) + 0.035 * sin(x * 3.0 + uTime * 0.7 + r * 9.0);
          vec3 p = vec3(x, h, -r * 7.5);
          vec4 mv = modelViewMatrix * vec4(p, 1.0);
          gl_Position = projectionMatrix * mv;
          gl_PointSize = uPx * (1.5 + 2.6 * (h / 2.3)) * (7.0 / -mv.z);
          vA = smoothstep(1.0, 0.78, r) * smoothstep(0.0, 0.04, r) * (0.3 + 0.7 * clamp(h / 1.1, 0.0, 1.0));
        }`,
      fragmentShader: `
        varying float vA;
        void main() {
          float d = length(gl_PointCoord - 0.5);
          float a = smoothstep(0.5, 0.15, d) * vA;
          gl_FragColor = vec4(vec3(0.94, 0.95, 0.97) * a, a);
        }`,
    });
    group.add(new Points(geo, mat));

    const still = matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
    const resize = () => {
      const w = canvas.clientWidth, h = canvas.clientHeight, a = w / h;
      renderer.setSize(w, h, false); camera.aspect = a; camera.updateProjectionMatrix();
      const wide = a > 1.4;
      group.userData.x = wide ? 1.9 : 0;
      group.userData.ry = wide ? -0.34 : 0;
      group.scale.setScalar(wide ? 1.6 : 0.92);
      camera.position.set(0, wide ? 2.6 : 3.0, wide ? 7.4 : 9.6);
      camera.lookAt(0, wide ? 1.05 : 0.9, -3.0);
      if (still) requestAnimationFrame(frame);
    };
    let mx = 0, my = 0, visible = true;
    addEventListener('pointermove', (e) => { mx = e.clientX / innerWidth - 0.5; my = e.clientY / innerHeight - 0.5; });
    new IntersectionObserver(([e]) => { visible = e.isIntersecting; }).observe(canvas);
    const t0 = performance.now();
    const frame = (now: number) => {
      if (visible || still) {
        mat.uniforms.uTime.value = still ? 6 : (now - t0) / 1000;
        group.position.x = group.userData.x;
        group.rotation.y = group.userData.ry + mx * 0.18;
        group.rotation.x = my * 0.06;
        renderer.render(scene, camera);
      }
      if (!still) requestAnimationFrame(frame);
    };
    resize(); addEventListener('resize', resize);
    if (!still) requestAnimationFrame(frame);
  }).catch(fallback);
</script>

<style is:global>
  section.hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;min-height:100vh;min-height:100svh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:radial-gradient(70% 90% at 66% 46%,#1b1e24 0,var(--ink) 62%)}
  .hero>.wrap{position:relative;flex:1;width:100%;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,600px) 1fr;align-items:center;padding-block:120px 64px}
  .hero h1{font-size:clamp(50px,6.8vw,100px);line-height:.98}
  .hero p.lede{margin:26px 0 0;max-width:40ch;font-size:19px;line-height:1.5;color:#b9bec7}
  .ctas{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:36px}
  .light .ctas{margin-top:30px}
  #stage{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;display:block}
  #stage-fallback{position:absolute;right:6%;top:50%;width:46%;transform:translateY(-50%);color:#d6d9de;opacity:.9}
  #stage-fallback .mark{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:52/45}
  .announce{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:30px;padding:5px 14px 5px 5px;border-radius:999px;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px #2c3036;background:rgba(17,19,22,.7);font-size:14px;color:#c8ccd3;transition:box-shadow .2s,color .2s}
  .announce:hover{box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px #4a4f58;color:#fff}
  .announce .tag{padding:3px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:#f3f4f6;color:#0b0c0e;font-size:12px;font-weight:600}

  .hero-tape{position:relative;z-index:1;min-height:65px;border-top:1px solid var(--line-d);background:rgba(11,12,14,.86);overflow:hidden;-webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#000 5%,#000 95%,transparent);mask-image:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#000 5%,#000 95%,transparent)}
  .hero-tape .track{display:flex;width:max-content;animation:mq 80s linear infinite}
  .hero-tape .track>div{display:flex}
  .tick{flex:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:18px 28px;border-right:1px solid var(--line-d);white-space:nowrap}
  .tick img{width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff}
  .tick .s{font-size:14.5px;font-weight:600}
  .tick .p{font-size:14.5px;color:#d9dce1}
  .tick .c{font-size:13px}
  @keyframes mq{to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}

  .sec.tight{padding-block:96px}
  .sec-head{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px 64px}
  .sec-head h2{font-size:clamp(36px,4.4vw,60px);line-height:1.02;max-width:14ch}
  .sec-head p{margin:0;max-width:44ch;font-size:17.5px;line-height:1.55}
  #trade .sec-head{align-items:center}
  .frame{margin-top:48px;border-radius:28px;background:var(--ink);padding:clamp(16px,4vw,56px);overflow:hidden}
  .shot{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #262a31,0 40px 80px -30px rgba(0,0,0,.8)}
  .cap{margin-top:22px;text-align:center;font-size:13px;color:var(--mute-l)}

  .filters{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:48px}
  .filters button{font:inherit;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:540;height:38px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:999px;border:0;cursor:pointer;background:var(--paper-2);color:var(--text);transition:background .15s,color .15s}
  .filters button:hover{background:#e9ebee}
  .filters button[aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--text);color:#fff}
  .tbl{margin-top:20px;overflow-x:auto}
  .tbl table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:720px}
  .tbl th{font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:var(--mute-l);text-align:left;padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--text)}
  .tbl td{padding:16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-l);font-size:16px}
  .tbl .r{text-align:right}
  .tbl tbody tr{transition:background .15s;cursor:pointer}
  .tbl tbody tr:hover{background:var(--paper-2)}
  .mk{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}
  .mk img{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%}
  .mk b{display:block;font-weight:580}
  .mk span{display:block;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--mute-l)}
  .go{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:36px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:999px;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px #d5d8dd;font-size:14px;font-weight:560}
  .go:hover{background:var(--text);color:#fff;box-shadow:none}

  .list.news a{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,180px) minmax(0,1fr) 24px}
  .list.news .src{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:540;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--text);line-height:1.5}
  .list.news time{color:var(--mute-l)}
  .list.news b{font-size:21px}
  .two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:40px 80px;align-items:start}
  .two h2{font-size:clamp(30px,3.2vw,44px);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.03em}
  .body{margin:0 0 18px;max-width:52ch;font-size:17.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--mute-l)}

  .vision ol{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:56px;max-width:980px}
  .vision li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px minmax(0,1fr);gap:16px}
  .vision .n{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--mute-d);padding-top:12px}
  .vision p{margin:0;font-family:var(--display);font-variation-settings:'opsz' 60;font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,40px);line-height:1.2;font-weight:300;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#e4e6ea;text-wrap:pretty}

  .points .wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 420px;gap:64px;align-items:center}
  .points .label{margin-bottom:18px}
  .points h2{font-size:clamp(36px,4.4vw,60px);line-height:1.02}
  .points p{margin:22px 0 0;max-width:46ch;font-size:17.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#b9bec7}
  .clock{background:var(--ink-2);border-radius:20px;padding:30px;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line-d)}
  .clock .lab{font-size:14px;color:var(--mute-d)}
  .clock .t{margin-top:10px;display:flex;gap:18px}
  .clock .t div{display:flex;flex-direction:column}
  .clock .t b{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:44px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1}
  .clock .t span{margin-top:6px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--mute-d)}
  .clock .pill{margin-top:28px;width:100%;justify-content:center}
  .clock .foot{margin-top:16px;font-size:13px;color:var(--mute-d)}

  @media (max-width:1100px){
    .hero>.wrap{order:1;flex:0 0 auto;grid-template-columns:1fr;padding-block:112px 8px}
    #stage,#stage-fallback{order:2;position:relative;inset:auto;width:100%;flex:1 1 300px;min-height:300px;height:auto;transform:none}
    #stage-fallback{max-width:420px;margin:0 auto}
    .hero-tape{order:3}
    .points .wrap,.two{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .list.news a{grid-template-columns:1fr auto}
    .list.news b{grid-column:1}
  }
  @media (max-width:760px){
    .tbl table{min-width:0}
    .tbl th:nth-child(n+4),.tbl td:nth-child(n+4){display:none}
    .tbl th,.tbl td{padding-inline:6px}
    .tbl th:first-child,.tbl td:first-child{padding-left:0}
    .tbl th:nth-child(3),.tbl td:nth-child(3){padding-right:0}
    .mk{gap:10px}
    .mk img{width:28px;height:28px}
    .clock .t{gap:12px}
    .clock .t b{font-size:34px}
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.hero-tape .track{animation:none}}
</style>
